{
  "id": "moist_air___partial_pressure_and_daltons_law",
  "title": "Moist Air - Partial Pressure and Daltons Law",
  "description": "Calculate the total pressure of moist air using Daltons Law of partial pressures. The total pressure is the sum of the partial pressures of dry air and water vapor.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Daltons Law of Partial Pressure\n\nDaltons Law states that *the total pressure of a mixture of gases is equal to the sum of the partial pressures of the constituent gases*.\n\nThe partial pressure is the pressure each gas would exert if it alone occupied the volume of the mixture.\n\n### Formula\n\n**p = pa + pw**\n\nWhere:\n- **p** = total pressure of air (Pa, N/m²)\n- **pa** = partial pressure of dry air (Pa, N/m²)\n- **pw** = partial pressure of water vapor (Pa, N/m²)\n\n### Alternative Formula\n\n**p = ρa × 286.9 × T + ρw × 455 × T**\n\nWhere:\n- **ρa** = density of air (kg/m³)\n- **ρw** = density of water vapor (kg/m³)\n- **T** = temperature (K)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Method 1: Direct Partial Pressures",
        "Method 2: Using Density and Temperature"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "partial_pressure_dry_air",
          "label": "Partial Pressure of Dry Air (pa)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "defaultValue": 98000
        },
        {
          "id": "partial_pressure_water_vapor",
          "label": "Partial Pressure of Water Vapor (pw)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "defaultValue": 2000
        },
        {
          "id": "density_air",
          "label": "Density of Air (ρa)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 1.225
        },
        {
          "id": "density_water_vapor",
          "label": "Density of Water Vapor (ρw)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 0.01
        },
        {
          "id": "temperature",
          "label": "Temperature (T)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "K",
          "defaultValue": 288.15
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "total_pressure_method1",
          "label": "Total Pressure (Method 1)",
          "formula": "inputs.partial_pressure_dry_air + inputs.partial_pressure_water_vapor",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_pressure_method2",
          "label": "Total Pressure (Method 2)",
          "formula": "inputs.density_air * 286.9 * inputs.temperature + inputs.density_water_vapor * 455 * inputs.temperature",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
